        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaykajeanda ea gitaabooda mwanang'",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaadaayi malaykajeanda nuut mideawa uurda nea ghwararang'aana humng'eeda, nea siikwealsa shamooghooda, nea uhuudaanyi gwanda gidaghuweang'da sheagiitka, nea gheamamdaanyi ghawaar aseeta, nea geeshangaaschi gawuurji daranajeega beasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gwandeawa gitaabooda mwanang' giitineat aba geatindaanyi. Ak ghoalaabwa geeshtaanyi bea geatinda dugwa jeeda basooda, nea geeshtaanyi ghaadaam ghoalaabwa badayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gooyeawda aba ghuuta haw, nea ghwanyaashta daghata dea ng'adiida; iidu nea gooyeawda, ghwanya ghuusigeaba giighweendanyeekiga asispwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata nyeashteaba giighweendanyeekiga asispwaan, abeeda ea neagasayi dang'waar, hean ghaayiinyi ghuuta leabu humng'eeda nea gwayi, “Aroora ng'asheesu rugu giighweendanyeekiga asispwaan, ak ea ading'waari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea malaykajeandida gwachi aadaayiin ghamiinaada aba jeeda basooda ea badayda ng'eanyiidean ghamiinda geatindaanyi bea dugwa googeal humng'eeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghwaak habeawooda aba ninyeeda majeek ea ghoah damanda manda muudeanooda, ninyeeda bwat humng'eeda ea haleanjeeda mida jeeda, ea ng'eanyiida ea haleanjeeda mida jeeda, ea basooda ea haleanjeeda mida jeeda, ak ea maygudugwanda shing'deayda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geaghus aba askwearjoojiga jea ghaghuuda durumbeati malaykajeandeaba ispwa, abeeda makcheameeda ASEETA aba heeda soomjoagaaschi was sibanga gaygamajeegiit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiikta goobaloolan ghuutida gwachi aayiinyi leabu humng'eedean nea gwayi, “Una, ak gigeandi gitaaboodida giitineat mida geatindeaba malaykajeandida miinaada aba badayda basooda ea badayda ng'eanyiidean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geaweesi malaykajeandida ak geayeeshi goona gitaaboani mwanang'iin; ak gwayeeshiinean, “Geanda, ak giyaagi; ak gayghang'waaniit aba jeadaang'u, nea aba ghuutaang'u gajea inyeanda maleeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geageandi gitaabooda mwanang' aba geatinda malaykajeanda ak ghaayaaji; ak ea inyeanda maleeda aba ghuuteanyu, hean iyaahiichi agita ghang'waaniit aba jeedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeeshiinean, “Gamiiseey rukuta gicha ramooranga aba badayda fuga saang'a ea eemoojiga ea iita ea sugoodiga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
